          "verification": [
            "Use temporary bare remotes and deterministic hooks to test replacement publication, movement after advertisement, unexpected remote deletion/update and target advancement after candidate publication.",
            "Test interruption before push, successful push before receipt persistence, failed push, repeated reconciliation and historical publication without adequate durable authority."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "P9",
          "description": "Keep implementation responsibilities cohesive. Place pure lineage decisions and evidence types in Model, workflow policy and settlement in Application, and replay/publication mechanisms in Infrastructure. Extract the affected responsibility families from the oversized behaviors and candidate_refresh modules with their helpers and tests, preserving stable entry points. Update only affected intent contracts for managed worktrees, planning/implementation lineage, recovery and replacement checks/publication; reconcile touched legacy wording with current Skills behavior.",
