          "description": "Run focused verification against the implementation in this pinned workspace, then report actual commands, selected test counts, results and exact candidate identity. Adapt useful Round 1 tests after correcting their unsafe assumptions. Preserve Round 1's 22 modified tracked files and 14 untracked files. Refine owns candidate commits and workflow advancement; source promotion and serving-daemon restart remain separate operator work.",
